    "detailed_description": "The current ruler and sheikh of Dubai has granted you the right to build and oversee a modern city and surrounding areas. This honorable privilege is a very demanding task. You start on a shoestring budget in the middle of the desert but with access to the waterfront. Your task will be to carefully manage the funds allocated to you for building the city. You must wisely design the city layout and provide appropriate living conditions for residents and the development of business and tourism.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610470/extras/8636e1ad765ef9060f261ad25a10c8d9.poster.avif?t=1747394691\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610470/extras/8636e1ad765ef9060f261ad25a10c8d9.webm?t=1747394691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610470/extras/8636e1ad765ef9060f261ad25a10c8d9.mp4?t=1747394691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Oil is a resource that ensures stable progress and development. Use nearby resources to finance the construction of the city and to meet the needs of your ruler. Use natural energy resources to ensure sustainable energy development.<br><br>The desert is not easy for rulers. You will struggle with many adversities such as heat, sandstorms and tornadoes. Remember that your greed in excessive taxes will increase dissatisfaction among your population. You better not endanger your honorable ruler.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mining and energy</strong></h2>Every prosperous city must make money. Build pumps to extract oil and a refinery to process it into fuel. Solar energy is a very effective way to power a city in the initial phase of construction (especially in the desert).<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610470/extras/da32b94e32d73ba6c998d18de6596d0a.poster.avif?t=1747394691\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610470/extras/da32b94e32d73ba6c998d18de6596d0a.webm?t=1747394691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610470/extras/da32b94e32d73ba6c998d18de6596d0a.mp4?t=1747394691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Districts</strong></h2>To ensure a sufficient number of workers, build villages and then districts with residences and hotels to ensure a stable increase in the number of specialists and tourists.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610470/extras/d01e1f580ca98e173b699a4adf166c39.poster.avif?t=1747394691\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610470/extras/d01e1f580ca98e173b699a4adf166c39.webm?t=1747394691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610470/extras/d01e1f580ca98e173b699a4adf166c39.mp4?t=1747394691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Taxes</strong></h2>Manage taxes for individual social classes to ensure stable financing. Be careful! Too much dissatisfaction can cause financial drain or much worse problems.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610470/extras/81bb6e906320d4acb1525db14518dd41.poster.avif?t=1747394691\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610470/extras/81bb6e906320d4acb1525db14518dd41.webm?t=1747394691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610470/extras/81bb6e906320d4acb1525db14518dd41.mp4?t=1747394691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create a dream island</strong></h2>Choose the shape of the island and build a tourist paradise whose fame will spread all over the world. As you progress in the game, you will unlock new islands (the city is much more difficult to adapt).<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610470/extras/429ad19724a36d5daae6e141d1be6e05.poster.avif?t=1747394691\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610470/extras/429ad19724a36d5daae6e141d1be6e05.webm?t=1747394691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610470/extras/429ad19724a36d5daae6e141d1be6e05.mp4?t=1747394691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build infrastructure</strong></h2>Start by building modern ports and promenades that will ensure stable profits from tourism. In the future, you will build large ports to transport your raw materials around the world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610470/extras/85d3eb7042445de80270cdcd64f6d5bd.poster.avif?t=1747394691\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610470/extras/85d3eb7042445de80270cdcd64f6d5bd.webm?t=1747394691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610470/extras/85d3eb7042445de80270cdcd64f6d5bd.mp4?t=1747394691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Desert</strong></h2>This incredibly beautiful desert landscape will be hit by many disasters. Provide an appropriate amount of rescue and warning infrastructure to prevent a tragedy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610470/extras/f0afbc9ebc8f1f866dc27c94a54918b8.poster.avif?t=1747394691\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610470/extras/f0afbc9ebc8f1f866dc27c94a54918b8.webm?t=1747394691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2610470/extras/f0afbc9ebc8f1f866dc27c94a54918b8.mp4?t=1747394691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
